<p class="govuk-body">Check with <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_not_allowed_to_have_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> first if you are:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>asked to use something mentioned in your licence conditions, for example for your job</li>
  <li>not sure whether something you own or need to use is covered by your licence condition</li>
</ul>
